UPDATE companies SET description='FM Welding Fabrication LLC operates from Ellicott City, Maryland, offering mobile welding and custom metal fabrication services. The company identifies as a licensed and insured certified welder/fabricator, though its founding year and ownership details are not publicly disclosed.

The shop specializes in mobile welding, custom metal fabrication, structural welding, repairs, equipment modifications, and on-site welding. Its technicians perform TIG, MIG, stick, and flux-core welding on aluminum, stainless steel, mild steel, and galvanized steel. No facility size, headcount, or production volumes are published.

Clients span residential, commercial, and industrial sectors, with mobile services dispatched to boats, industrial plants, facilities, government buildings, construction sites, trucks and trailers, and restaurants.

