rth Branch, MN. Whether you''re looking for new metal railings, trailer repairs, or unique fabrication, we''re here to help.", "founded_year": "2020", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='fab-metals-llc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Fabrilaser Manufacturing, LLC operates from Marshall, Michigan. It presents itself as a full‑service sheet metal fabricator.

The shop provides product design, engineering, manufacturing, and distribution services using advanced technology, moving from concept through fabrication to finished‑product delivery. Core processes include laser cutting, forming, welding, machining, and quality control, supported by computer‑aided design, state‑of‑the‑art robotics, and precision laser cutting equipment. The engineering team emphasizes challenging modern methods to transform customer ideas into finished products efficiently.

Fabrilaser serves government agencies, contractors, and manufacturers, delivering custom sheet metal products and helping designers and builders fabricate digital 3D concepts into product‑ready parts and construction‑ready materials.

