UPDATE companies SET description='Facet Furniture was founded in 2018 in Birmingham, Alabama, by Michael Morrow and the team at MDM Design Studio. The company began as a contemporary artisan furniture workshop focused on hand-built, made-to-order pieces for residential spaces.

The workshop produces a range of tables, credenzas, hutches, beds, mirrors, and seating, each crafted from solid woods such as white oak, walnut, and reclaimed oak, combined with materials like marble, forged brass, shagreen, and quartzite. Every piece is handcrafted from start to finish, employing traditional joinery such as dovetails and custom finishes across a palette of 19 options. Production is made-to-order, with no showroom inventory; each project begins with a client conversation to define dimensions, wood species, and finish.

The collection includes dining tables, coffee tables, credenzas, beds, vanities, and accent pieces, all tailored to the specific spatial and aesthetic requirements of the client.

The company distinguishes itself through its Italian-inspired design ethos and a commitment to handcrafting every joint, surface, and finish in its Birmingham atelier. Morrow and his team emphasize that they do not produce for showrooms but for the spaces where life happens, treating each detail as an opportunity for excellence.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom furniture design", "Made-to-order manufacturing", "Handcrafted joinery (dovetail, etc.)", "Custom wood finishing (19 finishes)", "Material selection (solid woods, marble, brass, shagreen, quartzite)", "Client consultation and space planning"], "industries": ["Residential furniture", "Interior design", "Luxury home furnishings", "Custom furniture manufacturing"], "materials": ["White Oak", "Walnut", "Reclaimed Oak", "Nero Marble", "Forged Brass", "Shagreen", "Bronze", "San Simone Quartzite", "Parchment"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Hand-built, made-to-order furniture with fully customizable dimensions, wood, and finish", "Italian-inspired design crafted in Birmingham by Michael Morrow and MDM Design Studio", "Every piece handcrafted from start to finish using traditional joinery (e.g., dovetail)", "No showroom inventory; each project begins with a client conversation", "19 custom finish options across solid woods, marble, brass, shagreen, and quartzite"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2018 in Birmingham, AL -> db and page ''/''", "Founder Michael Morrow and MDM Design Studio -> page ''/''", "Hand-built, made-to-order furniture -> page ''/''", "Materials: White Oak, Walnut, Reclaimed Oak, Nero Marble, Forged Brass, Shagreen, Bronze, San Simone Quartzite, Parchment -> page ''/''", "19 custom finishes -> page ''/''", "Products: tables, credenzas, hutches, beds, mirrors, seating -> page ''/''", "Italian-inspired design, handcrafted from start to finish -> page ''/''", "No showroom inventory; client conversation starts each project -