UPDATE companies SET description='Downs Food Group, operating as Fairmont Foods, is a family-owned food manufacturer headquartered in Fairmont, Minnesota. The business traces its roots to 1947 when Tony Downs purchased a produce business in St. James, Minnesota. Over the decades, the company expanded through acquisitions to become a fully-cooked protein processor and co-packer of frozen entrees.

