UPDATE companies SET description='The company has been serving the region since 1990, building a reputation for custom woodworking and architectural millwork. Master craftsman Ben Svec leads the shop, bringing more than 40 years of hands-on experience in design and fabrication to every project.

The shop produces a wide range of custom wood products, including architectural millwork, heirloom furniture, reproduction moldings, custom entry doors, specialty windows, and liturgical furniture. Capabilities extend to cabinetry, built-ins, staircases, fireplace mantels, and commercial interior and exterior packages. The team also offers vac-forming for curved frame and pergola components, hardware systems, and shop production with trial assembly to ensure fit before installation.

Falls Millwork serves residential homeowners, commercial contractors, and religious institutions across Central Iowa. Past projects include custom kitchen and bathroom cabinetry for private homes, complete interior packages for commercial offices, and liturgical furnishings such as altars and pews for churches. The company also reproduces vintage moldings and trim for historic restoration work.

The firm emphasizes a full-service approach from design through installation, with a focus on value and professionalism. Svec’s background in the broader building process allows the shop to coordinate with other trades, and the crew aims to leave each job site clean at the end of each day. Quality is described as never compromised, with pieces built to last a lifetime.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom woodworking", "Architectural millwork", "Heirloom furniture", "Reproduction moldings", "Custom entry doors", "Specialty windows", "Liturgical furniture", "Vintage reproductions", "Cabinetry", "Built-ins", "Staircases", "Fireplace mantels", "Commercial interiors and exteriors", "Vac-forming curved components", "Hardware systems", "Shop production trial assembly", "Custom moldings", "Door and window casing", "Baseboard", "Display cabinets", "Entertainment centers", "Specialty lighting", "Exterior trim", "Specialty projects"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial", "Liturgical"], "materials": ["Wood", "Stone", "Tile"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Full-service design-to-installation workflow", "Master craftsman with 40+ years experience", "Quality guaranteed with lifetime durability", "Job-site cleanliness maintained daily", "Serving Central Iowa since 1990"], "facts_used": ["Location: Kelley, Iowa -> db", "Founded 1990 -> /", "Master craftsman Ben Svec with 40+ years experience -> /about-us", "Services: custom woodworking, architectural millwork, heirloom furniture, reproduction moldings, custom entry doors, specialty windows, liturgical furniture, vintage reproductions, cabinetry, built-ins, staircases, fireplaces, commercial spaces -> /services", "Processes: vac-forming curved components, hardware systems, shop production trial assembly -> /products", "Industries: residential, commercial, liturgical -> /services", "Materials: wood, stone, tile -> /", "Differentiators: full-servi