UPDATE companies SET description='Farmville Wholesale Electric Supply Co., Inc. (FWESCO) was founded in 1972 in Farmville, Virginia, by Lynwood G. "Linnie" Smith. Smith and his two brothers had previously operated Smitty Brothers Electric Company, a contracting and retail firm, for over forty years after World War II. Smith''s ambition to operate at the wholesale level was realized through his two sons with the formation of FWESCO.

