UPDATE companies SET description='Fehrer Automotive operates from Gadsden, Alabama, as the U.S. arm of the Fehrer Group, which is integrated into the globally positioned AUNDE Group — one of the 100 largest automotive suppliers worldwide.

The company manufactures seat cushions, seat modules, and lightweight composite structures made from fiber-reinforced plastics. It provides full-service support from initial concept through series production, including design via more than 50 CAD workstations, CNC-milled prototypes, and on-site service centers at major OEM facilities that enable direct collaboration with customer engineering teams.

Fehrer serves automotive original equipment manufacturers, maintaining close proximity to OEMs through dedicated service centers. Its components are integrated into vehicle interiors across global platforms, with the company covering the complete value chain from development to serial delivery.

Fehrer differentiates itself through end-to-end process control, customer-located engineering support, and material innovations such as variPUR, a proprietary lightweight material system. The group emphasizes quality management certified to ISO 9001, ISO 14001, and IATF 16949 standards.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','ISO 14001','IATF 16949']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Concept-to-production full service", "Complete value chain management", "CAD design (50+ workstations)", "CNC milling for prototypes", "Composite component manufacturing", "Seat cushion production", "Seat module assembly", "On-site OEM engineering support"], "industries": ["Automotive", "Automotive OEM"], "materials": ["Fiber-reinforced plastics", "variPUR"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Full-service coverage from concept to series production", "Complete in-house value chain", "On-site service centers at OEM locations", "50+ CAD workstations including at customer sites"], "facts_used": ["Fehrer Automotive operates from Gadsden, Alabama -> db", "Part of AUNDE Group, one of the 100 largest automotive suppliers -> /", "Specializes in vehicle interior components: seat cushions, seat modules, composite components -> /", "Composite production since the 1980s -> /", "Certifications: ISO 9001, ISO 14001, IATF 16949 -> db", "Full service from idea to series production -> db", "50+ CAD workstations, service centers at OEMs -> db", "variPUR material innovation -> /", "Headquarters in Kitzingen (global), but this profile for Gadsden, Alabama -> / and db"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Wir sind einer der weltweit f\u00fchrenden Spezialisten f\u00fcr Komponenten im Fahrzeuginnenraum.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='fehrer-automotive' AND appr