UPDATE companies SET description='Felbro Food Products operates from Los Angeles, California, with a second facility in Compton. The company was founded in 1946 by brothers Maury and Sid Feldmar, who built the business around their shared interest in food formulation. The name Felbro derives from their surname. Ownership has remained in the family: the founders'' sons, Mike and Bart Feldmar, joined in 1967, and the third generation arrived in 2007 when Mike''s son Daniel entered the business. The firm moved from Venice Boulevard to its current Adams Boulevard location in 1972, expanded into the adjacent office building in 1982, and added the Compton site in 2006.

Felbro develops and manufactures custom food and beverage formulas for commercial clients. Its product range covers powders and liquids spanning sweet and savory profiles. The company provides full-service solutions that include ideation, product development, manufacturing scale-up, inventory management, and delivery.

Customers include quick-service restaurant chains, foodservice distributors, and branded food companies seeking private-label or co-manufacturing partners. Felbro describes itself as the behind-the-scenes team for some of the largest names in the food service industry, though specific client names are not public.

