UPDATE companies SET description='Food Service Specialties was founded in 1985 in Columbus, Wisconsin, by lifelong friends Don Leick and Steve Lineer. The pair started the business after a customer asked them to match and scale up a custom pizza sauce to achieve batch-to-batch consistency. The company remains family-owned, with the second generation now active in daily operations.

The firm formulates, manufactures, and customizes tomato- and dairy-based sauces for foodservice and retail channels. After outgrowing its original plant, FSS relocated to Red Wing, Minnesota, in 1998, constructing a 45,000-square-foot facility.

